From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nix-config integration <noreply@local>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] agentmemory: complete the existing OpenCode capture lifecycle

Provenance: repository-owned patch for AgentMemory e04ba88819c365c9acf9d6661ea802143e728bd6
Source: plugin/opencode/agentmemory-capture.ts
Scope: current OpenCode events, completed assistant content, tool lifecycle,
idle summarization, REST failure logging, normal disposal, and managed REST
configuration only.

This retains the upstream entrypoint, named export, standard REST routes,
five-second timeout, automatic context injection, compression, truncation,
session behavior, consolidation, and unrelated hooks.
